                                                          "values":  [
                                                                         {
                                                                             "content":  "=You are generating a single, ultra–high-resolution, photorealistic architectural fantasy image intended for viral short-form content.\n\nThe visual style must remain consistent across all generations: warm, luxurious, organic, calm, premium, and emotionally immersive.\n\nDo NOT copy, recreate, or closely resemble any existing or known image.\nDo NOT reference any real designer, brand, or account.\nThe scene must be original while maintaining the same signature aesthetic every time.\n\nScene type: {{ $json.sceneType }}\nEnvironment: {{ $json.environment }}\n\nContext realism rule (critical):\nThe architectural scene must always be logically integrated into a luxury residential structure.\n\nIf the scene type is a staircase, bedroom, hallway, or living space, it must be clearly located INSIDE a high-end home, with walls, ceilings, or architectural framing visible. The environment must appear OUTSIDE the structure through large windows, open walls, skylights, or architectural openings.\n\nIf the scene type is a patio, it must be an exterior space DIRECTLY CONNECTED to a luxury home, functioning as a natural extension of the structure.\n\nThe architecture must never exist isolated in nature without a supporting residential structure.\n\nDual-level visibility rule (critical):\nThe composition must clearly show BOTH the lower level and the upper level in the same frame.\n\nThe lower level must clearly function as a bedroom with a visible bed and defined sleeping area.\nThe upper level must be fully visible and must clearly function as either:\n- a second bedroom, or\n- a library / reading loft.\n\nThe upper level must not be partially hidden, cropped, implied, or out of frame.\nIt must be clearly readable as a distinct space with visible furniture, purpose, and boundaries.\n\nDesign a breathtaking architectural scene where natural wood is the dominant and overwhelming hero material.\n\nThe wood must feature:\n- rich live-edge slabs\n- deep, flowing grain patterns with visible swirls, knots, and natural imperfections\n- warm honey, amber, and golden-brown tones\n- subtle handcrafted etching and organic surface texture\n- a combination of polished smooth surfaces and raw, irregular natural edges\n\nThe wood should feel sculptural, fluid, and shaped by nature itself rather than cut or manufactured.\nAll wood elements must appear custom-carved, extremely expensive, and one-of-a-kind, with impossible craftsmanship that feels beyond real-world construction limits.\n\nThe architectural design must be organic and flowing:\n- curved forms instead of straight lines\n- seamless transitions between surfaces\n- natural integration between structure and environment\n- no rigid geometry, industrial design, or minimalism\n\nThe layout must be completely original and must NOT resemble common or overused concepts such as:\n- tree bunk beds\n- standalone staircases in nature\n- standard epoxy river floors\n- circular slab patios\n- typical luxury interior layouts\n\nThe surrounding environment must enhance the architecture visually, acting as a backdrop beyond the structure rather than competing with the interior design.\n\nSet a calm, peaceful, and aspirational atmosphere.\n\nLighting requirements:\n- warm golden-hour daylight\n- soft ambient glow\n- gentle shadows and subtle reflections\n- no harsh highlights\n- no cold or artificial lighting\n\nThe space should feel quiet, private, and serene, like a hidden high-end retreat designed for relaxation and escape.\n\nCamera and composition rules:\n- vertical 9:16 framing\n- cinematic depth of field\n- eye-level or slightly elevated camera angle\n- camera positioned far enough back to reveal the full vertical relationship between levels\n- natural foreground-to-background flow\n- composition that clearly shows the staircase, lower bedroom, and upper level together\n- optimized for high retention in short-form video\n\nDo NOT include:\n- people or human figures\n- workers or construction activity\n- tools, machinery, or unfinished elements\n- text, captions, logos, or watermarks\n- clutter or mess\n- futuristic or sci-fi elements\n- dark, gloomy, or nighttime scenes\n- cartoon, illustration, or painterly styles\n\nThe final image must look realistic yet visually unreal, luxurious, calming, and emotionally captivating.\nIt should immediately evoke awe, curiosity, and a strong desire to keep watching.\n"
                                                                         }
